OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday park expansion plan sparks
OL,4,Abacklash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA holiday park praised by visitors as
OL,7,F"idyllic" could be set for a major
OL,8,Fexpansion despite objections from
OL,9,Fresidents.
OL,11,FDevon Hills Holiday Park, near
OL,12,FPaignton, Devon, has applied for
OL,13,Fpermission to build more than 50 new
OL,14,Fholiday lodges on its site off the
OL,15,FTotnes road at Blagdon.
OL,17,FTorbay Council planning officers have
OL,18,Frecommended the scheme for approval
OL,19,Fahead of a planning committee meeting
OL,20,Fon Monday.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
