OL,3,GNEWSAHoliday park expansion plan sparks
OL,4,Abacklash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals have proved controversial
OL,7,Famong some existing lodge owners,
OL,8,Fparticularly because part of the
OL,9,Fdevelopment would be built on the
OL,10,FMoonshadow Rise area, which has been
OL,11,Fused as a dog walking field.
